      "paperId": "59fda59f3c3f8d7ee4ee6a5abf977219660d3bec",
      "title": "Philosophy as a Way of Life, the System, and the Advent of the Research University: Contributions Toward an Unwritten Chapter of the History of PWL",
      "authors": [
